A quote is an ordinary link destination character

```
[x](a"b)
.
<p><a href="a&quot;b">x</a></p>
```

```
[x](a"b "t")
.
<p><a href="a&quot;b" title="t">x</a></p>
```

```
[x](")
.
<p><a href="&quot;">x</a></p>
```

```
[x]("t")
.
<p><a href="&quot;t&quot;">x</a></p>
```

```
[x](a`b{c}d|e^f<g>h)
.
<p><a href="a`b{c}d|e^f&lt;g&gt;h">x</a></p>
```
